xt<openparen>path<closeparen><openbracket>1<closebracket>.lower<openparen><closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>ext<space>==<space><apos>.ttl<apos>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>with<space>open<openparen>path<comma><space><apos>r<apos><comma><space>encoding=<apos>utf-8<apos><closeparen><space>as<space>f:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>g<space>=<space>Graph<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>g.parse<openparen>data=f.read<openparen><closeparen><comma><space>format=<quote>turtle<quote><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>graph<space>=<space>graph<space>+<space>g<lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>elif<space>ext<space>==<space><apos>.zip<apos>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>temp_dir<space>=<space>tempfile.mkdtemp<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>with<space>zipfile.ZipFile<openparen>path<comma><space><apos>r<apos><closeparen><space>as<space>zf:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>zf.extractall<openparen>temp_dir<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>for<space>root<comma><space>dirs<comma><space>files<space>in<space>os.walk<openparen>temp_dir<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>for<space>fname<space>in<space>files:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>fname.lower<openparen><closeparen>.endswith<openparen><apos>.ttl<apos><closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>ttl_path<space>=<space>os.path.join<openparen>root<comma><space>fname<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>with<space>open<openparen>ttl_path<comma><space><apos>r<apos><comma><space>encoding=<apos>utf-8<apos><closeparen><space>as<space>f:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>g<space>=<space>Graph<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>g.parse<openparen>data=f.read<openparen><closeparen><comma><space>format=<quote>turtle<quote><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>graph<space>=<space>graph<space>+<space>g<lf><lf><space><space><space><space><sp